{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 36, :comments ["<b>To discipline you.</b> To bring you to the level of prophecy through the reception of the Torah, as in the case of Elijah: וְהִנֵּה רוּחַ גְּדוֹלָה וְחָזָק (1 Kings 19:11). And likewise, וְעַל הָאָרֶץ הֶרְאֲךָ אֶת אִשּׁוֹ (\"and on earth He showed you His fire\"), as in that same matter, as it says: וְאַחַר הָרַעַשׁ אֵשׁ (1 Kings 19:12)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:20:30.385870191Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}